  "label": "The text 'brace yourself' maps onto the man's smug expression",
  "description": "The top text overlay 'brace yourself' is juxtaposed with the man's smug, self-satisfied facial expression. This creates an analogical mapping where the text instructs the viewer to prepare for something, and the visual material (the man's expression) embodies that state of confident anticipation. The mapping is direct: the text 'brace yourself' is mapped onto the visual entity of the man's smug expression, implying that his demeanor is the thing one must brace for.",
